        "statement": "See “Risk Factors — Because the markets in which we operate are highly competitive and many of our competitors have greater resources than we have, we cannot be certain that our products will compete favorably in the marketplace” in Item 3 above.",
        "start_character": 22758,
        "end_character": 23004
