        "accession_number": "0001193125-26-197184",
        "filing_date": "2026-04-30",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "Since SSDs and mobile embedded storage products are defined by continuously evolving industry standards such as those relating to, but are not limited to, the Peripheral Component Interconnect Express, or PCIe, host interface, nonvolatile memory express, or NVMe, data transfer protocol and UFS storage specification, we provide controllers for the latest versions of these industry standards and design our solutions for customers to build storage devices with competitive product performance and compatibility with host devices.",
